[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695697009","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103526#issuecomment-2695697009","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103526","id":2695697009,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6grRJx","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T22:19:46Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T22:20:37Z","body":"Indeed, it seems like while refactoring this code in #39945 I made two mistakes:\r\n- Changing `horz && vert` to `horz || vert` as pointed out above.\r\n- The unified method also checks `_NET_WM_ACTION_MAXIMIZE_HORZ` while the previous code checked `_NET_WM_STATE_MAXIMIZED_HORZ` (action vs state). I assume they mean different things.\r\n\r\nCC @bruvzg @Riteo - I might poke eventually at fixing up my mistake but I figure you might understand this code better than I do.\r\n\r\n*Edit:* Oh I missed that this was a PR and not a bug report. Then I guess my first PR feedback is to check the second point I make above.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695697009/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695818671","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103526#issuecomment-2695818671","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103526","id":2695818671,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gru2v","user":{"login":"jamie-pate","id":682658,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MjY1OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/682658?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate","html_url":"https://github.com/jamie-pate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T23:41:48Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T23:46:21Z","body":"The current master branch checks both STATE and ACTION since https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/2eb36b8bdb137f8164974dddd1d63646c27b23b4:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blame/master/platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp#L2564\r\n```\r\n\t\tif (strcmp(p_atom_name, \"_NET_WM_STATE\") == 0) {\r\n\t\t\twm_act_max_horz = XInternAtom(x11_display, \"_NET_WM_STATE_MAXIMIZED_HORZ\", False);\r\n\t\t\twm_act_max_vert = XInternAtom(x11_display, \"_NET_WM_STATE_MAXIMIZED_VERT\", False);\r\n\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\twm_act_max_horz = XInternAtom(x11_display, \"_NET_WM_ACTION_MAXIMIZE_HORZ\", False);\r\n\t\t\twm_act_max_vert = XInternAtom(x11_display, \"_NET_WM_ACTION_MAXIMIZE_VERT\", False);\r\n\t\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI just realized that `both_axes` is always true when the atom is `_NET_WM_STATE`, so I switched to using the atom_name instead of an extra parameter.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695818671/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701704633","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103526#issuecomment-2701704633","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103526","id":2701704633,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hCL25","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T18:09:20Z","updated_at":"2025-0